&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Luno is the crypto investment app you can rely on, enabling you to buy, store and explore crypto securely. We’re committed to putting the power of cryptocurrency in everyone&#39;s hands, sensibly and responsibly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2013, we’ve helped millions of people around the world invest safely in crypto. We do this by cutting through the hype and supporting customers at every step of the way. All products and cryptocurrencies on our platform must first meet stringent legal, risk and technical security standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Transparency is key for us. Luno stores all crypto on a 1:1 basis and we have rigorous processes in place so you can be confident your investment is secure. We&#39;re available in multiple markets around the world and we work closely with regulators and other key stakeholders to ensure compliance with local laws, as we believe this is the best way to help everyone, everywhere, invest safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an execution-focused Head of Privacy and DPO to lead and scale our data protection programme across our three core business lines. This is a hands-on, pragmatic leadership role designed for a commercially minded individual who knows how to navigate conflicting mandates. You will serve as an approachable internal partner, translating complex legal obligations into actionable advice and controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the global privacy compliance strategy across our markets and three core businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and scale the group-wide privacy framework to ensure continued compliance with key data protection and privacy laws of jurisdictions, including the UK, South Africa (POPIA), Nigeria (NDPA), Malaysia (PDPA), and Indonesia (PDP Law).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the official DPO where required locally, oversee local outsourced DPOs, and serve as the primary liaison for regulators and external auditors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor global legal shifts, translating regulatory changes into technical controls and product roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver regular risk reports and compliance updates to the Chief Legal Officer and Executive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed privacy-by-design into product, engineering, and operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the assistance of the Privacy Associate and Legal Support Specialists, manage day-to-day operations, including Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs), Records of Processing Activities (ROPA), data subject access requests (DSARs), and vendor risk reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the support of legal counsel, draft, negotiate, and review Data Processing Agreements (DPAs) and cross-border transfer mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the assessment of potential privacy breaches and communication to regulators and affected data subjects under tight regulatory timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the general data protection training curriculum and deliver tailored, role-based privacy training for high-risk functions, including Anti-Financial Crime, Product, Engineering, and People teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the maintenance and improvement of the Privacy Team’s operational tools and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct and mentor the Privacy Associate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build collaborative working relationships across InfoSec, Risk, Internal Audit, and the leadership of the three core businesses and the product, engineering and marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A little about you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years in a legal advisory or compliance role focussing on designing and implementing global privacy and data protection frameworks and 2+ years in a senior leadership or management role. Fintech or B2B financial services experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep knowledge of the GDPR and POPIA and working knowledge of privacy regimes across Africa and APAC EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Certifications:&lt;/strong&gt; Law degree preferred but not essential. Advanced degrees in information law or IAPP certifications (CIPP/E, CIPM) are highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience implementing privacy automation tools (consent management platforms, automated ROPA, vendor monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A pragmatic, default stance of &quot;how can we do this safely?&quot; rather than &quot;no.&quot; Capable of communicating effectively with software engineers, C-suite executives, and regional regulators alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Luno:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote but reachable work policy gives you the freedom to choose between working from home or the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus the option to buy and sell up to 5 days leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve body and mind, with excellent private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy peace of mind with Luno&#39;s comprehensive retirement fund and essential risk benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Learnably and our additional learning platforms for your personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months primary care-giver leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paw-ternity leave for your furry friend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Inspiration Day in addition to your annual leave which increases based on your length of service!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, friendly work community, with regular social events and virtual cooking, dancing, drawing and house planting classes hosted by our Lunauts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch and snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0 fees up to a certain amount with Luno from the day you start.*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Offer only available on Luno Instant Buy, not Luno Exchange&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Luno is the crypto investment app you can rely on, enabling you to buy, store and explore crypto securely. We’re committed to putting the power of cryptocurrency in everyone&#39;s hands, sensibly and responsibly.&amp;nbsp;Since 2013, we’ve helped millions of people around the world invest safely in crypto. We do this by cutting through the hype and supporting customers at every step of the way. All products and cryptocurrencies on our platform must first meet stringent legal, risk and technical security standards.Transparency is key for us. Luno stores all crypto on a 1:1 basis and we have rigorous processes in place so you can be confident your investment is secure. &lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re available in multiple markets around the world and we work closely with regulators and other key stakeholders to ensure compliance with local laws,&lt;/strong&gt; as we believe this is the best way to help everyone, everywhere, invest safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will form part of the&lt;strong&gt; AML, CTF, CPF &amp;amp; Sanctions&lt;/strong&gt; Team based in South Africa, Malaysia and Indonesia, and you will report to the Head: AML, CTF, CPF &amp;amp; Sanctions in South Africa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our AML, CTF, CPF &amp;amp; Sanctions Team is responsible for the implementation of money laundering, terrorist financing, proliferation financing and sanctions risk mitigation controls for Luno&#39;s global business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our mission is to create a world class AML, CTF, CPF &amp;amp; Sanctions Team that keeps both Luno and our customers safe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work in a fast paced environment, collaborating with other business units, including Engineering, Product, Countries and Legal teams, servicing the business on an international level together with the teams from Africa, Asia Pacific and the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make sure we have the processes and information available that enable us to understand our risk, and using this foundation, we respond to any money laundering, terrorist financing, proliferation financing and sanctions related risks in a swift coordinated way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage AML screening, including sanctions, PEP, adverse media, watchlist, employee/vendor screening, and geolocation controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage transaction monitoring controls, including on-chain, off-chain, and Travel Rule monitoring and associated outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimise AML systems and controls, including rule tuning, threshold management, and performance oversight of key AML tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee control performance, including queue management, SLA adherence, quality assurance, control effectiveness, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide day-to-day people leadership, including workload management, performance oversight, coaching, development, and team support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A little about you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tertiary Education, to the equivalent of a graduate will be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relevant industry recognised certification such as ACAMS, ACFE, ACFCS, SAIFM etc, as applicable to the AML, CTF, CPF &amp;amp; Sanctions, field would be beneficial, especially if the certification focuses on crypto currencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 7 years work experience in an AML, CTF, CPF &amp;amp; Sanctions related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 1 year experience managing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and delivering team SMART Goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day-to-day management of all aspects of screening, transaction monitoring and the outcomes thereof in respect of: sanctions, adverse media and political exposure, private watch lists, geolocation, geofencing, off-chain monitoring, on-chain monitoring and travel rule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory portal management on an operational basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with compiling professional-quality reports that can be shared with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Luno:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote but reachable work policy gives you the freedom to choose between working from home or the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus the option to buy and sell up to 5 days leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve body and mind, with excellent private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement fund benefit helping you build the financial foundation you need to enjoy your future to the fullest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Learnably and our additional learning platforms for your personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months primary care-giver leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paw-ternity leave for your furry friend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Inspiration Day in addition to your annual leave which increases based on your length of service!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, friendly work community, with regular social events and virtual cooking, dancing, drawing and house planting classes hosted by our Lunauts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch and snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0 fees up to a certain amount with Luno from the day you start.*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Offer only available on Luno Instant Buy, not Luno Exchange.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_71305f38cc12c3e5-19&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10044 citation-10045 citation-10046 citation-10047 citation-10048 citation-10049 citation-end-10049&quot;&gt;Luno is the crypto investment app you can rely on, enabling you to buy, store and explore crypto securely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10038 citation-10039 citation-10040 citation-10041 citation-10042 citation-10043 citation-end-10043&quot;&gt;. We’re committed to putting the power of cryptocurrency in everyone&#39;s hands, sensibly and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10038 citation-10039 citation-10040 citation-10041 citation-10042 citation-end-10042&quot;&gt; responsibly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10033 citation-10034 citation-10035 citation-10036 citation-10037 citation-end-10037&quot;&gt;. Since 2013, we’ve helped millions of people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10033 citation-10034 citation-10035 citation-10036 citation-end-10036&quot;&gt; around the world &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10033 citation-10034 citation-10035 citation-end-10035&quot;&gt;invest safely in crypto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10030 citation-10031 citation-10032 citation-end-10032&quot;&gt;. We do this by cutting through the hype and supporting custo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10030 citation-10031&quot;&gt;mers at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10029 citation-10030 citation-10031 citation-end-10031&quot;&gt;every step of the way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10026 citation-10027 citation-10028 citation-end-10028&quot;&gt;. All products and cryptocurrencies on our platform must first meet stringent legal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10026 citation-10027 citation-end-10027&quot;&gt;, risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10026 citation-end-10026&quot;&gt; and technical security standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4,10&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10025 citation-end-10025&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_71305f38cc12c3e5-20&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10024 citation-end-10024&quot;&gt;Transparency is key for us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-10023 citation-end-10023&quot;&gt;. Luno stores all crypto on a 1:&lt;/span&gt;1 basis and we have rigorous processes in place so you can be confident your investment is secure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4&quot;&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re available in multiple markets around the world and we work closely with regulators and other key stakeholders to ensure compliance with local laws&lt;/strong&gt;, as we believe this is the best way to help everyone, everywhere, invest safely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;You will report into Jeremy Jeesandaran, Head of Marketing (SEA) and be provided with an exciting opportunity to join a collaborative, cross-functional environment where marketing, compliance, and product teams work closely together to build community trust across Southeast Asia.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Build and Grow the Luno Community. Help Luno expand its presence across SEA markets through engaging online and offline community events, accessible educational content, and high-impact marketing campaigns. You will also support the growth of our Affiliate Marketing channel and assist with SEO implementation, learning firsthand how a regulated crypto exchange fosters trust and brings new users into the ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Drive Community Initiatives and Events:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help plan and run online and in-person community events, including meetups, workshops, webinars, campus sessions, and AMAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end event logistics covering venues, invitations, run-of-show, materials, and on-the-day support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and pitch new community initiatives, partnerships, and programmes that help everyday people understand crypto and Luno.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor community channels to spot recurring questions, sentiment shifts, and emerging topics, flagging insights to the team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Execute Marketing Campaigns:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design of marketing campaigns from initial concept and messaging through to channel planning and creative briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with campaign launches across channels, coordinating closely with design, content, and compliance teams for reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track campaign performance and share concise summaries of key learnings and recommendations for future iterations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Grow Affiliate Marketing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, reach out to, and onboard new affiliates—including content creators, communities, and education platforms—to expand Luno&#39;s affiliate channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support existing affiliates with creative briefs, approved marketing materials, and timely responses to common inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track affiliate performance, sign-ups, and payouts, flagging top performers and potential issues to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review affiliate content to ensure alignment with Luno&#39;s brand and compliance guidelines, escalating any non-compliance promptly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Support SEO Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in implementing on-page SEO updates across Luno&#39;s website and educational content, including metadata, headings, internal links, and image alt text.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help publish and update educational articles and landing pages with target keywords properly integrated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct routine SEO health checks (such as identifying broken links and page issues) and track keyword rankings and traffic for key pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A little about you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Must-Have Qualifications &amp;amp; Traits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently enrolled in, or recently graduated from, a degree or diploma in Communications, Marketing, Media, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong written and spoken English and Bahasa Melayu; proficiency in Mandarin or other local languages is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly detail-oriented and organised, capable of juggling event logistics, campaign deadlines, and affiliate follow-ups simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creativity &amp;amp; Proactivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Eager to bring fresh, practical ideas to the table for community initiatives, campaigns, and partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Comfort:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working with numbers to track performance in spreadsheets and summarise what the data shows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; Genuine interest in crypto, fintech, or personal finance, paired with a willingness to learn fast in a regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience organising events, campus activities, or community programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic familiarity with SEO or web analytics tools (such as Google Analytics, Search Console, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with affiliate, influencer, or partnership outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience moderating or managing a community, social page, or Discord/Reddit group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic design or content editing skills (e.g., Canva, Higgsfield, or similar tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to Apply?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;Apply through Luno&#39;s careers page. Include your CV and a short note on why you&#39;d be a great fit for building Luno&#39;s community. Links to any decks, events, campaigns, videos, or community work you&#39;ve done are welcome but not required. Shortlisted candidates may be asked to complete a short take-home task.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will gain:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running community engagement for a global crypto exchange across three platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A public on-camera portfolio of explainer videos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to how brand, compliance and community teams work together in a regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Luno:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote but reachable work policy gives you the freedom to choose between working from home or the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, friendly work community, with regular social events and virtual cooking, dancing, drawing and house planting classes hosted by our Lunauts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch and snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
