&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Luno is the crypto investment app you can rely on, enabling you to buy, store and explore crypto securely. We’re committed to putting the power of cryptocurrency in everyone&#39;s hands, sensibly and responsibly. Since 2013, we’ve helped millions of people around the world invest safely in crypto. We do this by cutting through the hype and supporting customers at every step of the way. All products and cryptocurrencies on our platform must first meet stringent legal, risk and technical security standards.Transparency is key for us. Luno stores all crypto on a 1:1 basis and we have rigorous processes in place so you can be confident your investment is secure. We&#39;re available in multiple markets around the world and&lt;strong&gt; we work closely with regulators and other key stakeholders to ensure compliance with local laws&lt;/strong&gt;, as we believe this is the best way to help everyone, everywhere, invest safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into Iman Astofi, our Social Media Manager, based in Indonesia. This is an amazing opportunity to join our Marketing (Social) team and learn how a regulated crypto exchange builds trust with its community across the APAC/Global market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help our social team keep Luno&#39;s community conversations active, helpful, and on-brand across channels including Facebook, Instagram, X, LinkedIn, and Reddit in the APAC/Global market. You&#39;ll also be the on-camera face of our explainer videos, helping everyday people understand crypto and Luno products in plain language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Community engagement (Facebook, Instagram, Reddit):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor comments, DMs, mentions, and Reddit threads, and reply in Luno&#39;s tone of voice within agreed response times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Answer common questions using approved resources, and route anything about accounts, security, complaints, or regulation to the right team rather than answering it yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot recurring questions, sentiment shifts, and emerging topics, and flag them to the Social Media Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help moderate communities: remove spam and scams, and escalate abuse, impersonation, and phishing attempts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support community activations such as polls, Q&amp;amp;As, giveaways, and AMAs, including follow-up with participants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- On-camera talent for explainer videos:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the presenter in short explainer videos that make crypto and Luno products easy to understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the team to brainstorm, script, and storyboard video ideas so they sound natural, accurate, and relatable to our Malaysian audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in shoots and recordings, and be comfortable delivering to camera across several takes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within brand and compliance guidelines: no investment advice, price predictions, or hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Content and reporting support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help draft captions, community posts, and replies for review, and help to provide reports on social media performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track social media metrics, response times, and community themes, and share a short summary with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect community feedback and content ideas, including from Reddit and comment threads, to feed future explainers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A little about you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant Experience &amp;amp; Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently enrolled in, or recently graduated from, a degree or diploma in Communications, Marketing, Media, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong written English and Bahasa Melayu; Mandarin or other local languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Camera Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills and comfortable on camera—clear, natural, and confident delivery, with the willingness to be the public face of Luno content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Cultural Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Active user of Facebook, Instagram, and Reddit, with a good feel for each platform&#39;s culture and etiquette. Deeply familiar with the internet cultures, trends, and etiquettes of Instagram, Facebook, and especially Reddit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creativity &amp;amp; Proactivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Creative and proactive to bring fresh ideas to the table for both community building and video content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Judgement &amp;amp; Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Good judgement and a calm, friendly tone when dealing with frustrated or confused online community members. Organised, reliable, and able to take feedback quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in crypto, fintech, or personal finance (or a willingness to learn fast)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;experience moderating or managing a community, channel, page, or Discord/Reddit group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;basic video or photo editing skills (CapCut, Canva, or similar); or prior content creation, presenting, or public speaking experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to Apply?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply through Luno&#39;s careers page. Include your CV and a short note on why you&#39;d be a good face for Luno. A link to any video, presenting, or community work you&#39;ve done is welcome but not required. Shortlisted candidates will be asked for a short on-camera screen test.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll gain:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running community engagement for a global crypto exchange across three platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A public on-camera portfolio of explainer videos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct mentoring from the person who manages social across all Luno markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to how brand, compliance, and community teams work together in a regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Luno:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote but reachable work policy gives you the freedom to choose between working from home or the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, friendly work community, with regular social events and virtual cooking, dancing, drawing and house planting classes hosted by our Lunauts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch and snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
